message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "FerriteSolidMechanics.jl"
abstract: >-
  Reusable material model interfaces and a shared finite element assembly path
  on top of Ferrite.jl. Application and research code writes the constitutive
  model at the quadrature point (UMAT-like) level; the package handles DOFs,
  sparse assembly, threading, MPI reduction, and trial/commit state updating.
